There's been interest in PEG parsers that are available to work in the
browser but people couldn't understand what are the correct links.

On Github we have an account maintained by several people (including the
Treasurer of the Logical Language Group) so I made this website:
https://lojban.github.io/ilmentufa/

<https://lojban.github.io/ilmentufa/>
It includes links to the latest camxes parsers made by different people
including the so called "experimental grammar camxes" from
https://github.com/Ilmen-vodhr/ilmentufa/ repository.

PS. Please note that earlier posted links to these parsers hosted at
mw.lojban. org/extensions/ will now redirect to the address above for its
stability.

